Text form
The info word after the language pins one fence, here to the box-drawing form on every sink:
  ┌────────┐     ┌────────┐     ┌──────┐
  │ Author │────▸│ Render │────▸│ Read │
  └────────┘     └────────┘     └──────┘
Markup
The <Mermaid> widget authors a diagram outside a fence: its source is the default slot's text, or a
file read through the page's store, and render pins the form as the info word does.
             ┌───────────────┐   ┌────────────────┐
             │ mermaid fence │   │ Mermaid widget │
