Choosing the form
The form is the diagram-render cascade property, Auto, Svg or Text, inherited like a text property,
so it is set at three grains: an app-wide <Rule> in the rule set, a page root's
bx:style="diagram-render=Text", or one diagram's fence info word (mermaid text) and <Mermaid
render="Text"> prop. Auto is the picture on the web; on a terminal a flowchart is text, since it
reflows to the columns and selects, and every other type a raster where the session's terminal draws
kitty graphics, else text. A build without the svg renderer shows the text form for every mode.